# --- IDE & Build Folders ---
# Ignore the folders where the compiler puts the 'translated' code
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/.settings/
**/.cache/

# --- Compiled Binary Files ---
# These are the large files you actually flash to the chip. 
# You don't need these on GitHub because they can be rebuilt from your code.
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.lst
*.axf

# --- Project & Local Config ---
# These store your personal window layout and local paths
*.uvguix.*
*.uvoptx
*.bak
*.dep